    <briefdescription>
<para>Test that verifies the plugin&apos;s plugin-build-info.properties integration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The plugin reads XDK version and default JVM arguments from plugin-build-info.properties, which is generated at plugin build time and included in both the build directory and the published JAR. </para>
<para>This test verifies:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>The plugin reads the XDK version from plugin-build-info.properties successfully</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The plugin reads default JVM arguments from plugin-build-info.properties successfully</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The xtcVersion property can be overridden by users regardless of default value</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>This works both in local development (TestKit) and when published </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
